  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bulk Procurement of Medicine to the GoM- Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to establish effective systems for a centralized, evidence-based procurement mechanism in Maldives, to ensure transparent, quality, cost-efficient and sustainable public procurement. With rising fiscal pressures and significant health-related procurement expenditures, the project will build on the flagship partnership with UNDP Maldives through the 2023-2024 Project Initiation Plan (PIP) &#x201c;Supporting the Government of Maldives to procure medicines at scale for driving efficiency</narrative>
  </description>
